    ]
  },
  "reflection": {
    "what_people_were_focused_on": "Clinton was preparing to take office, carmakers had mixed fortunes, and researchers were testing cleaner ways to wash clothes.",
    "what_actually_mattered": "Company paths mattered over the entire holding period. Ending well did not mean avoiding losses along the way, and these three shares did not represent every business.",
    "what_faded_away": "The excitement of a new presidency and a holiday movie did not reveal the final stock ranking. Interesting news and useful price forecasts are different things.",
    "what_nobody_knew": "IBM’s eventual lead could not be read from its starting reputation or partnerships. Investors still had to face uncertainty while events unfolded.",
